#: ../../how-to/interop.md:53 2c90ce601ae043849f25a3ebeca6f20c
msgid ""
"If you want to convert a live object to a **storage format or container**, "
"start with A."
msgstr "**手元のオブジェクトを保存形式やコンテナに写したい**なら A を見てください。"

#: ../../how-to/interop.md:54 9823369162644ab7adc064e9f92d93b8
msgid ""
"If you want to convert to **analysis objects** such as pandas, xarray, "
"astropy, or dask, start with B."
msgstr "**pandas / xarray / astropy / dask のような解析オブジェクトに写したい**なら B を見てください。"

#: ../../how-to/interop.md:55 c8102c00262d4955bd5e5a713a9ebafc
msgid ""
"If you want to hand data to **PyTorch, TensorFlow, JAX, or CuPy**, start "
"with C."
msgstr "**PyTorch / TensorFlow / JAX / CuPy に渡したい**なら C を見てください。"

#: ../../how-to/interop.md:56 c2e5494dab7042b489085d979309072e
msgid ""
"If you want to connect to **ROOT, ObsPy, LAL, PyCBC**, or other domain-"
"specific libraries, start with D."
msgstr "**ROOT / ObsPy / LAL / PyCBC などの分野別ライブラリに接続したい**なら D を見てください。"

#: ../../how-to/interop.md:57 7ec2bae25b1b45f28dfe286ca1f5bcf5
msgid ""
"If you want to move **Field** objects into xarray, NetCDF4, or Zarr "
"workflows via `to_*()` / `from_*()`, treat that as interop, not as direct "
"I/O."
msgstr ""
"**Field を xarray / NetCDF4 / Zarr に `to_*()` / `from_*()` で渡したい**場合は、I/O "
"ではなく interop として扱います。"

